@1 = ~Hydra~

// Summon Hydra (wizard level 9)
@2 = ~Summon Hydra~
@3 = ~Summon Hydra
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 9
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons a many-headed hydra to fight for the wizard. It obeys the caster until the spell ends or it is slain.

Hydra: HP 110, AC 2, THAC0 7, 3 attacks per round with its heads (2d6+3 piercing damage, +3 weapon). The hydra has 75% acid resistance and is immune to fear.~
